---
/**
 * The chip "fylls i" (design system Placeholder, `sl-todo`): marks a fact the association has
 * not given yet, instead of making one up. Say what is missing in the slot, e.g. "nummer fylls i".
 * Works on cotton and, inside `.on-green`, on green. The styles live in global.css, so that
 * a post's Markdown can use the same markup: <span class="sl-todo">fylls i</span>.
 */
---

<span class="sl-todo"><slot>fylls i</slot></span>
